{"path":"locale/time_get/date_order","title":"std::time_get<CharT,InputIt>::date_order, std::time_get<CharT,InputIt>::do_date_order","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::time_get&lt;CharT,InputIt&gt;::</span>date_order, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::time_get&lt;CharT,InputIt&gt;::</span>do_date_order","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/time_get/date_order","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The valid values (inherited from std::time_base) are:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>dateorder date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> dateorder do_date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Public member function, calls the protected virtual member function <code>do_date_order</code> of the most derived class.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns a value of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\">std::time_base::dateorder</a></span>, which describes the default date format used by this locale (expected by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_get/get_date\">get_date()</a></span> and produced by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/strftime\">std::strftime()</a></span> with format specifier <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">'%x'</span></span></code>).</div>\n<p>The valid values (inherited from <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\">std::time_base</a></span>) are:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>no_order</code>\n</td>\n<td> the format contains variable items (week day, Julian day, etc), or this function is not implemented\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>dmy</code>\n</td>\n<td> day, month, year (European locales)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>mdy</code>\n</td>\n<td> month, day, year (American locales)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>ymd</code>\n</td>\n<td> year, month, day (Asian locales)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>ydm</code>\n</td>\n<td> year, day, month (rare)\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A value of type <code>dateorder</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is optional, it may return <code>no_order</code> in every case.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The output below was obtained using clang (libc++).</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> show_date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1941\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">dateorder</span></span></a> d <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_get\"><span class=\"kw1966\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_get</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n                                      <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                                  <span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">date_order</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">switch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>d<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1942\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">no_order</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"no_order<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1943\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">dmy</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"day, month, year<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1944\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">mdy</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"month, day, year<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1945\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ymd</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"year, month, day<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"><span class=\"kw1946\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ydm</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"year, day, month<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/global\"><span class=\"kw2701\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">global</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"In U.S. locale, the default date order is: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show_date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/global\"><span class=\"kw2701\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">global</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"ja_JP.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"In Japanese locale, the default date order is: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show_date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/global\"><span class=\"kw2701\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">global</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"de_DE.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"In German locale, the default date order is: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    show_date_order<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>In U.S. locale, the default date order is: month, day, year\nIn Japanese locale, the default date order is: year, month, day\nIn German locale, the default date order is: day, month, year</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_get/get_date\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_get_date</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  extracts month, day, and year from input stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/time_base\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>time_base</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines date format constants <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/time_get","title":"std::time_get"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::time_get<CharT,InputIt>::date_order, std::time_get<CharT,InputIt>::do_date_order","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Public member function, calls the protected virtual member function do_date_order of the most derived class."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A value of type dateorder."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is optional, it may return no_order in every case."},{"label":"Example","note":"The output below was obtained using clang (libc++)."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"do_get_date","note":"extracts month, day, and year from input stream"},{"label":"time_base","note":"defines date format constants"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":289,"codeBlockCount":2}
